{
  "description": "Application for non-material amendments under Section 96A of the Town and Country Planning Act 1990 (as amended) to planning permission 24/00836/FULEIA (dated 28.10.2025) for the following works:\r(a)\tAmendment to condition 99 (Approved Drawings) for design changes including (i) adjustment to building location within the site (ii) changes to exit locations at ground level and associated alteration to City Market floorspace (iii) increase in height of cycle hub roof by 1.4m (iv) increase in height of main building by 400mm (v) removal of columns at ground floor (vi) introduction of new public route (vii) façade changes to structural beams, and (viii) other associated works;\r(b)\tAmendment to Description of Development to reflect proposed phasing of the development;\r(c)\tIntroduction of new condition related to phasing of the development;\r(d)\tAmendment to Condition 3 (Servicing Bay Headroom) to reduce the headroom to 3.7m;\r(e)\tAmendment to Condition 61 (Building Height) to accommodate changes;\r(f)\tAmendment to Condition 87 (Fire Strategy) to update the document reference;\r(g)\tAmendment to Condition 88 (Approved Floorspace) to reflect the changes; and\r(h)\tAssociated amendments to conditions 17, 20, 21, 22, 29, 34, 36, 37, 39, 40, 44, 45, 46, 48, 50, 52, 59, 73, 77, 78, 79, 80, 81, 82, 93, 94, and 95 to reflect the above changes.\r",
